Issues encountered and resolved during dvc repro --force:
  1. mlflow not installed → pip install mlflow==3.16.1
  2. MLflow DB schema out of date → python -m mlflow db upgrade sqlite:///mlflow.db
  3. mlflow.sklearn.log_model crashing on RandomForest/SVR/LinearRegression
     with UntrustedTypesFoundException (sklearn.tree._tree.Tree not in
     skops_trusted_types) → fixed in train_salary.py and train_salary_zero_outliers.py
  4. cross_val_score.py calling FinalFeatureSelector() with no args →
     fixed to pass feature_columns=FINAL_FEATURES


